        <ul class="mb-4 ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Posting the updated policy on our website;</li><li>Updating the "Effective Date" at the top of this page;</li><li>Sending an email notification for significant changes.</li></ul>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">An updated Privacy Policy describes our practices from its effective date. Continued use of the Services after that date is not your consent to any collection or use for which applicable law requires separate consent; where it does, we ask for that consent separately (§1).</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Version 1.3 of this Privacy Policy is announced at least thirty (30) days before it takes effect, by email to the address on file and by in-product notification. On its effective date it applies to everyone who uses the Services, whether or not they have accepted or acknowledged it. Where the Services ask you to acknowledge or accept this Privacy Policy, we keep a record of that as described in §2.10, as evidence that it was provided to you; your acceptance is not a condition of this Privacy Policy applying to our practices or of your rights under it.</p>
